<title>UK: Saudi cuts May crude to Europe 20-50 cts - trade.</title>
<headline>Saudi cuts May crude to Europe 20-50 cts - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabian Aramco cut the price of its crude to European term lifters in May by between 20 and 50 cents a barrel, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It cut Arab Light crude by 30 cents to Dated Brent -$2.25, its Berri Extra Light by 20 cents to Dated Brent -$1.35 and its Arab Heavy by 50 cents to Dated Brent -$4.30, they said.  </p>
<p>There was no immediate word on May prices into Europe for Arab Medium.</p>
<p>-- William Maclean London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
